@extends('layouts.app')

@section('content')
<div class="container docs-shell">
    @include('partials.docs-side')
    <article class="docs-body">
        <h1>Mail</h1>
        <p>Mail does not require an SMTP server. The <code class="inline">log</code> driver writes a line to the application logger. The <code class="inline">array</code> driver stores messages in memory for tests.</p>

        <pre><code>Mail.send("ada@example.com", "Welcome", "&lt;p&gt;Hello&lt;/p&gt;")

Mail.send {
    to("ada@example.com")
    subject("Welcome")
    html("&lt;p&gt;Hello&lt;/p&gt;")
}</code></pre>
        <p>Set <code class="inline">MAIL_DRIVER=array</code> in tests and inspect <code class="inline">app.make(ArrayMailer::class).messages</code>. Set <code class="inline">MAIL_DRIVER=smtp</code> with <code class="inline">MAIL_HOST</code>, <code class="inline">MAIL_PORT</code>, <code class="inline">MAIL_USERNAME</code>, <code class="inline">MAIL_PASSWORD</code>, and <code class="inline">MAIL_FROM</code> to send through SMTP. The default stays <code class="inline">log</code>.</p>
    </article>
</div>
@endsection
